{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clutchtime</strong> is a deck builder centered around <strong>basketball plays</strong> and <strong>team synergies</strong>. The <strong>Tournament Edition</strong> brings you 6 difficulty levels which you unlock one by one by winning all games in a single-elimination tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/store-bracket.png?t=1742421327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each team has a starting deck of 5 players with 3 cards representing their skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/store-player-cards.png?t=1742421327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade, trade and remove those cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/store-card-upgrade.png?t=1742421327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each quarter, you get to pick new cards to add for this game. At the end of the match, you can keep one of those cards in your deck until the end of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/store-cards-row1b.png?t=1742421327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This unique game mechanics allows you to try different cards and builds while playing the match without having to commit to it for the rest of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/store-chapms.png?t=1742421327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to become a champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap